B past participle: denied doing/having done. Both accepted."},{"answer":"to show","accept":[],"options":["showing","to show","show","to showing"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I can\u0027t wait ___ you the photos.","hint":"can\u0027t wait \u002B ?","explanation":"can\u0027t wait \u002B to-infinitive: can\u0027t wait to show."}]}